    "name":  "Pack 10 Transparent Connectors for joining LED COB + SMD strips - 8mm - 10mm - IP20",
    "reference":  "CTIIP20-10MM-92076",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eQuick \u003cstrong\u003etransparent\u003c/strong\u003e joining connector without soldering for non-waterproof \u003cstrong\u003eCOB and SMD strips\u003c/strong\u003e IP20 with 8mm and 10mm PCB. Our \u003cstrong\u003eIP20 quick connector\u003c/strong\u003e allows connections in LED strips without soldering, simply by pressing the connector\u0027s side clips. Super easy installation. Being transparent, the joints are unnoticeable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003eThe 8mm and 10mm quick connectors are sold in packs of 10 units.\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e1 unit = 10 connectors\u003c/h5\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eTransparent Connector for joining COB and SMD LED strips - 8mm - 10mm - IP20\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur connector allows joining all types of 8mm and 10mm LED strips:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- For COB LED strips.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e- For SMD LED strips.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eEasy installation thanks to quick Click system.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConsider connector dimensions if inserting into aluminum or polycarbonate profile.\u003c/p\u003e",
